#! rate=44118 block=64 tracks=8 end=176472
# Acid Gen (a GPL MIDI effect, engines/midi_fx/acid_gen.c) with Keys = Run:
# its line plays while the sequencer's transport runs, from step 1 at Start,
# and Stop ends its note. Track 1 holds a note on step 1 for two bars, which
# the chain takes as a held key: it transposes the line while it sounds.
@0 bpm 13600;tog 0 0 52 100;slen 0 0 0 -1 192
@17664 play
@154368 stop
